Y\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall x\\in Y\\;\\neg(xRy)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the minimal-element characterization of the canonical two-place well-foundedness predicate on the declared field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}wellfnd}\\ \\vdash\\\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall x\\in Y\\;\\neg(xRy)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":836,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4015","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-prop-wellfnd.md|58-prop-wellfnd]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["9e70b896da231f4f"]}